:root{color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
.k-bg{background:#0b0d12!important}
.k-card{background:#12151c!important;border-color:#232836!important}
.k-fg{color:#eef0f5!important}
.k-muted{color:#9aa1b2!important}
.k-link{color:#5b7cff!important}
.k-btn{background:#5b7cff!important;color:#0b0d12!important}
.k-mark{background:#5b7cff!important;color:#0b0d12!important}
.k-quote{border-color:#566285!important;color:#eef0f5!important}
}
</style>
</head>
<body class="k-bg" style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f7f8fa;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0">Entra in Northwind Apparel con il ruolo operazioni.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="k-bg" style="background:#f7f8fa">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td class="k-mark" width="28" height="28" align="center" style="width:28px;height:28px;background:#2b59ff;color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:28px">K</td>
<td class="k-fg" style="padding-left:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#0b0d12">Keel</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="k-card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:8px;padding:24px">
<p class="k-fg" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0b0d12">Giulia ti ha aggiunto a Northwind Apparel con il ruolo operazioni.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:16px 0"><tr><td class="k-btn" style="background:#2b59ff;border-radius:8px"><a class="k-btn" href="https://app.keel.example/login" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px">Accedi</a></td></tr></table>
<p class="k-muted" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b6170">Se il pulsante non funziona, copia questo link nel browser:<br><a class="k-link" href="https://app.keel.example/login" style="color:#2b59ff;word-break:break-all">https://app.keel.example/login</a></p>
<p class="k-muted" style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b6170">Accedi con questo indirizzo email: ti mandiamo un link, senza password.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="k-muted" style="padding:16px 4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#5b6170">
Ricevi questa email perché usi Keel.<br>Domande? Scrivi a support@keel.example.<br>Keel Labs S.r.l. · Via Example 1, 20100 Milano<br><a class="k-link" href="https://app.keel.example/u/signed" style="color:#5b6170">Non ricevere più queste email</a>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Giulia ti ha invitato in Northwind Apparel su Keel",
  "text": "Giulia ti ha aggiunto a Northwind Apparel con il ruolo operazioni.

Accedi: https://app.keel.example/login

Accedi con questo indirizzo email: ti mandiamo un link, senza password.

--

