<td class="k-fg" style="padding-left:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#0b0d12">Keel</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="k-card" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:8px;padding:24px">
<p class="k-fg" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0b0d12">Hello Tessitura Rossi, Northwind Apparel sent you purchase order PO-0042. Please confirm it or tell us about any problem from the page below.</p>
<p class="k-fg" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#0b0d12">Expected delivery: Oct 20, 2026</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:16px 0"><tr><td class="k-btn" style="background:#2b59ff;border-radius:8px"><a class="k-btn" href="https://app.keel.example/supplier/po/tok" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px">View and confirm the order</a></td></tr></table>
<p class="k-muted" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b6170">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br><a class="k-link" href="https://app.keel.example/supplier/po/tok" style="color:#2b59ff;word-break:break-all">https://app.keel.example/supplier/po/tok</a></p>
<p class="k-muted" style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b6170">The link is personal to this order.</p>
